   Kantharuban Sivalingam : CASSCF convergence/infrastructure, NEVPT2 and variants, FIC-MRCI
   Bernardo de Souza      : ESD, SOC TD-DFT
   Georgi Stoychev        : AutoAux, RI-MP2 NMR, DLPNO-MP2 response, X2C
